---
layout: base.njk
title: Social
description: YouTube, TikTok, Twitch and X. Recent videos where they fit, and a link for each one.
permalink: /social/
---
{% from "video.njk" import feedSlide %}

<header class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker">Elsewhere</p>
  <h1>Social</h1>
  <p class="lede">The same person, a few different rooms. Each one is set up the way that site works best, and every name below was checked before it was linked.</p>
</header>

{% for key in ["spooky", "life"] %}
{% set ch = youtube.channels[key] %}
<section class="platform" id="yt-{{ ch.key }}" aria-labelledby="yt-{{ ch.key }}-title">
  <p class="kicker">YouTube · @{{ ch.handle }}</p>
  <h2 id="yt-{{ ch.key }}-title">{{ ch.name }}</h2>
  <p>{{ ch.blurb }}</p>
  <p class="page-actions"><a class="btn" href="{{ ch.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me">Open channel<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>
  {% if ch.ok %}
  <div class="yt-row">
    <button type="button" class="yt-arrow yt-arrow-prev" aria-label="Previous videos">‹</button>
    <div class="yt-feed" data-youtube-live="{{ ch.key }}" data-youtube-mode="feed" data-youtube-count="12" tabindex="0" aria-label="Recent videos from {{ ch.name }}">
      {%- for video in ch.videos | head(12) %}
      {{ feedSlide(video) }}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="yt-arrow yt-arrow-next" aria-label="Next videos">›</button>
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <div class="yt-media playlist-fallback">
    <button type="button" class="yt-play" data-playlist="{{ ch.uploads }}" aria-label="Play recent uploads from {{ ch.name }}">
      <span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% endfor %}

<section class="platform" id="tiktok" aria-labelledby="tiktok-title">
  <p class="kicker">TikTok · {{ social.tiktok.handle }}</p>
  <h2 id="tiktok-title">{{ social.tiktok.name }}</h2>
  <p>Recent clips from the channel. If the row below stays empty, the button still opens it.</p>
  <p class="page-actions"><a class="btn" href="{{ social.tiktok.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me">Open TikTok<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>
  <div class="tiktok-hold">
    <blockquote class="tiktok-embed" cite="{{ social.tiktok.url }}" data-unique-id="spookybaron" data-embed-from="oembed" data-embed-type="creator">
      <section>
        <a class="tiktok-fallback" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ social.tiktok.url }}?refer=creator_embed">
          <span class="monogram" aria-hidden="true">SB</span>
          <span>
            <strong>{{ social.tiktok.name }}</strong>
            <span>{{ social.tiktok.handle }} on TikTok</span>
          </span>
        </a>
      </section>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
  <script async src="https://www.tiktok.com/embed.js"></script>
</section>

<section class="platform" id="twitch" aria-labelledby="twitch-title">
  <p class="kicker">Twitch · {{ social.twitch.handle }}</p>
  <h2 id="twitch-title">{{ social.twitch.name }}</h2>
  <p>The player shows the stream when it’s live, and Twitch’s offline screen when it isn’t.</p>
  <p class="page-actions"><a class="btn" href="{{ social.twitch.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me">Open Twitch<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>
  <div class="twitch-slot" data-channel="{{ social.twitch.handle }}">
    <p class="twitch-waiting">Player loading…</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="platform" id="x" aria-labelledby="x-title">
  <p class="kicker">X · {{ social.x.handle }}</p>
  <h2 id="x-title" class="visually-hidden">{{ social.x.name }} on X</h2>
  <article class="x-card">
    <div class="monogram" aria-hidden="true">SB</div>
    <div>
      <p class="x-name">{{ social.x.name }}</p>
      <p class="handle">{{ social.x.handle }}</p>
      <p>Posts and clips. Follow along on X.</p>
      <p class="page-actions"><a class="btn" href="{{ social.x.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me">Follow on X<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
